    * From my understanding, if a patient visits the medsynora centre, they are given a unique encounter ID which they will use everywhere in the facility.
    * With the use of this encounter ID, special tests are done to them at admission and at discharge. If multiple tests are done on them at either of these stages,
		all the records for the various special tests done should have a common specialTest_ID indicating that the tests were all done at a single go.
	
