					24856			2156			Discharge	D-Dimer									0.72
					24857			2156			Discharge	Erythrocyte Sedimentation Rate (ESR)	16.09
        
	* So I will standardize the specialTest_ID column to indicate a single unique identifier for ALL the tests done to a patient at EACH phase.
